Data
----
nextrecordable downloads and processes, at run time, data published by the
U.S. Department of Labor:

  * OSHA Injury Tracking Application (ITA) establishment-specific injury and
    illness data (Form 300A summaries; Forms 300/301 case detail).
  * DOL OSHA enforcement data (osha_inspection, osha_violation).

These are works of the U.S. federal government and are in the public domain
in the United States. They are not redistributed in this repository.
nextrecordable is an independent project and is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or produced on behalf of OSHA or the Department of Labor.
